<title>USA: Applied Extrusion warns on Q3.</title>
<headline>Applied Extrusion warns on Q3.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON, Ma 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Extrusion Technologies Inc said in a statement accompanying second quarter earnings that maintenance costs and downtime on machines at its Terre Haute plant could impact on third quarter earnings.</p>
<p>The company said that the downtime had prevented it from reaching second quarter earnings targets and added that, although major equipment problems have now been resolved, &quot;there will be some impact on third quarter financial results from these operating issues&quot;</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsroom 212 859 1700))</p>
